  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now, Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi></math></p><p>On differentiating both sides we get :<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Then solution is not possible as&nbsp;there is no proper substitution.</p><p>Note: This question was bonus in Jee&nbsp;Mains 2023 April session.</p></blockquote>",
